# Run by supercronic in the scheduler container.
# Fetch all feeds every 15 minutes (conditional GET keeps this cheap).
*/15 * * * * swipe-rss fetch
# Extract the text of saved articles every minute (only due entries; usually nothing to do).
* * * * * swipe-rss extract
# Delete expired items (2 days after fetch) and saved entries (2 weeks after the save), hourly,
# away from the fetch runs. Swipes and tombstones are never deleted.
7 * * * * swipe-rss prune
